    "Scan of the 1986 edition of the Kaweah, California, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1983; field checked in 1984; photo inspected in 1993; photo revised in 1994; last revised in 1986; printed in 1994.",
    "Release: Provisional. Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 21.4 x 26.7 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
